      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLOW BAYOU (1) impressed on both occasions winning in best times, 25.31 latest and 29.50 two back. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Looks the one to beat. YUKI (2) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to place two back then came home strongly into second (30.16) in a Grade 5 at this track last time. Solid record at the distance winning nine races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Must be included in calculations. HARA'S TYRION (8) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and three minors from 12 tries. Comes off a (25.31) win last time, scoring by 4 lengths in a Grade 5 over 457m at Q Lakeside. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. JANE'S JET (5) is worth consideration after filling a hole at this course and distance last start.",
